audit=['# Sprint 2 — S41–S60','','Current code audit: 2026-10-25. Original S01–S20 is the visual authority. Sprint 1 approved to continue; stop after Sprint 2 for user review. All data, maps, documents, prices and notes are illustrative. No Flutter production code changed.','','## Inventory correction','','OwnerListingsScreen directly returns OwnerPropertiesScreen, already covered by S16. It is now a reconciled alias, not a new screen. The remaining inventory is 278 destinations in 14 sprints (13 × 20, final 18). S41–S57 retain their IDs; the later unbuilt IDs shift by one. Sprint 2 ends with the real AddPropertyPhotosPage.','','## Material behavior constraints','','- Fixed-light native splash is intentional in the source, even in dark mode. Gallery is an immersive dark media surface in both themes.','- Workspace selection is presentation intent, not an authentication or company-authorization grant.','- Unknown support writes and continuation/payment checks must recover the original operation; never offer blind resubmission.','- Current and accepted historical policies are distinct. Missing accepted history must not fall back to current. Mock legal/terms text is explicitly illustrative.','- Map area filtering acts on loaded results. The offline map art is schematic and makes no geographic accuracy claim.','- Visit mutations require fresh authoritative data and permission; pending requests are not confirmed visits.','- Property media currently requires 10–25 nonduplicate photos and a prepared 1–60-second video, separately from virtual-tour capture.','','## Visual contract','','Inherited original CSS, Readex/Plex fonts, exact signature/icon registry, compact fields/actions, forest hub headers and restrained cards. Main-screen visual lineage is recorded per screen. Native text scaling, device permissions, safe areas, API behaviors and map/media runtimes still require native verification during implementation.','','## Screen audit','']
for s in screens:
    audit += [f'<a id="{s["id"].lower()}"></a>',f'## {s["id"]} — {s["english"]}','',f'Source: `{s["source"]}`','',s['behavior'],'','Original visual references: '+', '.join(s['visualReference'])+'.','','Required implementation states: '+', '.join(s['requiredStates'])+'.','','Rendered review variants: '+', '.join(s['variants'])+'.','','Read dependencies: '+', '.join('`'+d['source']+'`' for d in s['dependencies'])+'.','']
audit+=['## Delivery gate','','Sprint 3 remains unstarted. User review/confirmation is required before creating further mockups.']
(OUT/'AUDIT.md').write_text('\n'.join(audit)+'\n')
(OUT/'README.md').write_text('# Sprint 2 — S41–S60\n\n[Open mockups](index.html) · [Source and behavior audit](AUDIT.md) · [Sprint plan](../SPRINT-PLAN.md)\n\n20 new screens in Light/Dark/System, using the original proposal style. All interactions and sample content are local. Splash stays light and media viewer stays dark, matching their source-defined behavior. Maps are schematic illustrations. No Flutter implementation was performed.\n\nIndividual PNGs and four-screen sheets are in `exports/`. Long forms/lists scroll in the HTML. See the sprint plan for the current batch and review gate.\n')
print('Built Sprint 2: 20 distinct screens, '+str(OUT/'index.html'))

